                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 to inclosure 1 in No.
                        938.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Advertisement taken from “El Bolivarense,” No. 1101, April 14, 1884.</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Arrested.</hi></p>
                <p>Since yesterday, the 12th instant, Messrs. John Dalton &amp; Co., Palazzi
                    Hermanos, P. Battistini &amp; Co., Hahn, Grillet &amp; Co., Kuhn &amp; Co., N.
                    Gardes &amp; Co., C. Vicentini &amp; Co., Frustuck Hermanos, Louis A. Portillo,
                    Monch, Kraft &amp; Co., and Michelangeli &amp; Figarella are under arrest in the
                    barracks of the national garrison by order of the federal Executive.</p>
            </div>
